129a salad nh\u00e9. T\u00f4i m\u00ea th\u1ecbt l\u1eafm!\``},{`en`:`[[In]] [[the]] [[kitchen]], Grandma [[works|work]] [[fast]]. [[She]] [[cuts|cut]] [[tomatoes|tomato]], [[onions|onion]] [[and]] [[carrots|carrot]] [[for]] [[the]] [[salad]]. [[She]] [[puts|put]] [[salt]] [[and]] [[black]] [[pepper]] [[on]] [[the]] [[chicken]]. [[Then]] [[she]] [[adds|add]] [[some]] [[hot]] [[potatoes|potato]]. \`[[A]] [[big]] [[man]] [[needs|need]] [[a]] [[big]] [[meal]],\` [[she]] [[says|say]].`,`vn`:`Trong b\u1ebfp, b\u00e0 l\u00e0m r\u1ea5t nhanh. B\u00e0 th\u00e1i c\u00e0 chua, h\u00e0nh t\u00e2y v\u00e0 c\u00e0 r\u1ed1t \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ed9n salad. B\u00e0 r\u1eafc mu\u1ed1i v\u00e0 h\u1ea1t ti\u00eau \u0111en l\u00ean th\u1ecbt g\u00e0. R\u1ed3i b\u00e0 th\u00eam m\u1ea5y c\u1ee7 khoai t\u00e2y n\u00f3ng h\u1ed5i. \`Ng\u01b0\u1eddi to th\u00ec ph\u1ea3i \u0103n b\u1eefa to,\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i.`},{`en`:`Tom [[eats|eat]] [[everything]]: [[the]] [[sandwich]], [[the]] [[salad]] [[and]] [[the]] [[potatoes|potato]]. \`[[This]] [[dish]] [[is|be]] [[wonderful]]!\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[I]] [[am|be]] [[on]] [[a]] [[diet]], [[but]] [[can]] [[I]] [[have]] [[chocolate]] [[cake]] [[with]] [[cream]]? [[And]] [[ice cream]] [[too]]?\` Mai [[laughs|laugh]]. \`[[That]] [[is|be]] [[a]] [[funny]] [[diet]]!\``,`vn`:`Tom \u0103n s\u1ea1ch: b\u00e1nh m\u00ec k\u1eb9p, salad v\u00e0 c\u1ea3 khoai t\u00e2y. \`M\u00f3n n\u00e0y tuy\u1ec7t qu\u00e1!\` anh n\u00f3i. \`T\u00f4i \u0111ang \u0103n ki\u00eang, nh\u01b0ng cho t\u00f4i b\u00e1nh s\u00f4-c\u00f4-la v\u1edbi kem t\u01b0\u01a1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng? Th\u00eam c\u1ea3 kem l\u1ea1nh n\u1eefa?\` Mai b\u1eadt c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`\u0102n ki\u00eang g\u00ec m\u00e0 bu\u1ed3n c\u01b0\u1eddi v\u1eady!\``},{`en`:`[[After]] [[the]] [[meal]], Grandma [[brings|bring]] [[some]] [[fruit]] [[from]] [[her]] [[garden]]: [[apples|apple]] [[and]] [[bananas|banana]]. Tom [[eats|eat]] an [[apple]] [[and]] [[drinks|drink]] [[a]] [[big]] [[glass]] [[of]] [[juice]]. [[Now]] [[he]] [[is|be]] [[not]] [[hungry]] [[or]] [[thirsty]]. \`[[This]] [[is|be]] [[the]] [[best]] [[food]] [[in]] Hanoi,\` [[he]] [[says|say]]. \`[[Can]] [[I]] [[come]] [[back]] [[tomorrow]]?\``,`vn`:`Sau b\u1eefa \u0103n, b\u00e0 mang ra \u00edt hoa qu\u1ea3 h\u00e1i trong v\u01b0\u1eddn: t\u00e1o v\u00e0 chu\u1ed1i. Tom \u0103n m\u1ed9t qu\u1ea3 t\u00e1o v\u00e0 u\u1ed1ng m\u1ed9t c\u1ed1c n\u01b0\u1edbc \u00e9p th\u1eadt to. Gi\u1edd th\u00ec anh h\u1ebft \u0111\u00f3i, h\u1ebft kh\u00e1t r\u1ed3i. \`\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed3 \u0103n ngon nh\u1ea5t H\u00e0 N\u1ed9i,\` anh n\u00f3i. \`Ng\u00e0y mai t\u00f4i quay l\u1ea1i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c kh\u00f4ng?\``},{`en`:`\`[[Of]] [[course]]!\` [[says|say]] Grandma. Tom [[smiles|smile]]. \`[[Good]]. [[My]] [[friends|friend]] [[want]] [[to]] [[come]] [[too]]. [[All]] [[twenty]] [[of]] [[them]]!\` Mai [[and]] Grandma [[look]] [[at]] [[each]] [[other]]. [[Twenty]] [[people]]? [[In]] [[their]] [[small]] [[kitchen]]?`,`vn`:`\`T\u1ea5t nhi\u00ean r\u1ed3i!\` b\u00e0 n\u00f3i. Tom m\u1ec9m c\u01b0\u1eddi. \`T\u1ed1t qu\u00e1. B\u1ea1n t\u00f4i c\u0169ng mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ebfn. C\u1ea3 hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ng\u01b0\u1eddi lu\u00f4n!\` Mai v\u00e0 b\u00e0 nh\u00ecn nhau. Hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ng\u01b0\u1eddi? Trong c\u0103n b\u1ebfp nh\u1ecf x\u00edu n\u00e0y sao?`}],`tease`:`Hai b\u00e0 ch\u00e1u s\u1ebd n\u1ea5u cho hai m\u01b0\u01a1i ng\u01b0\u1eddi th\u1ebf n\u00e0o \u0111\u00e2y?`}]}